  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lagos State Employment Trust (LSETF)- Honeytreat Trade Academy Skills Project 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The LSETF- Honeytreat Trade Academy Skills Project 2 will address youth unemployment in Lagos by improving job skills and employment outcomes in a variety of sectors, including construction, domestic power supply and solar installation, water supply and waste management, woodwork and cabinet making, tiling and brickwork, and steel fixing, welding, and fabrication.</narrative>
  </description>
